title Ch06.10: 통신 구조 - Order Service 구조

package "Order Service (Port 8080)" {
    component "OrderController" as OrderController
    component "OrderService" as OrderService
    component "OrderRepository" as OrderRepository
    component "PaymentClient\n(WebClient)" as PaymentClient
    
    database "Order DB\n(orderdb)" as OrderDB {
        entity "orders" as Orders {
            * id : BIGINT <<PK>>
            --
            * customer_id : VARCHAR(255)
            * product_id : VARCHAR(255)
            * quantity : INT
            * total_price : BIGINT
            * status : VARCHAR(50)
            * created_at : TIMESTAMP
            * updated_at : TIMESTAMP
        }
    }
    
    note right of PaymentClient
        WebClient 설정:
        - 연결 타임아웃: 5초
        - 응답 타임아웃: 10초
        - Non-blocking I/O
    end note
    
    note right of OrderDB
        커넥션 풀:
        - 최대 20개
        - 독립적 관리
    end note
}

OrderController --> OrderService
OrderService --> OrderRepository
OrderService --> PaymentClient
OrderRepository --> OrderDB

