@startuml
!theme plain
allowmixing
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF

title Ch06.10: 통신 구조 - API 통신 시퀀스 (정상 케이스)

participant "Client" as Client
participant "Order Service\n(Port 8080)" as OrderService
database "Order DB\n(orderdb)" as OrderDB
participant "PaymentClient\n(WebClient)" as PaymentClient
participant "Payment Service\n(Port 8081)" as PaymentService
database "Payment DB\n(paymentdb)" as PaymentDB

Client -> OrderService: POST /api/orders\n(OrderCreateRequest)
activate OrderService

OrderService -> OrderDB: 주문 데이터 저장\n(PENDING 상태)
activate OrderDB
OrderDB --> OrderService: Order Entity
deactivate OrderDB

OrderService -> PaymentClient: processPayment(request)\nMono<PaymentResponse>
activate PaymentClient

note right of PaymentClient
    WebClient 호출:
    - Non-blocking I/O
    - Resilience4j 적용
    - Circuit Breaker
    - Retry
    - Timeout
end note

PaymentClient -> PaymentService: POST /api/payments\n(PaymentCreateRequest)\nREST API 호출
activate PaymentService

PaymentService -> PaymentDB: 결제 데이터 저장\n(PENDING 상태)
activate PaymentDB
PaymentDB --> PaymentService: Payment Entity
deactivate PaymentDB

PaymentService -> PaymentService: PG사 결제 요청\n(시뮬레이션)
note right of PaymentService
    결제 처리:
    - PG사 API 호출
    - 재시도 로직
    - 실패 시 보상 트랜잭션
end note

PaymentService -> PaymentDB: 결제 상태 업데이트\n(COMPLETED)
activate PaymentDB
PaymentDB --> PaymentService: Payment Entity
deactivate PaymentDB

PaymentService --> PaymentClient: PaymentResponse\n(결제 결과)
deactivate PaymentService

PaymentClient --> OrderService: Mono<PaymentResponse>
deactivate PaymentClient

OrderService -> OrderDB: 주문 상태 업데이트\n(CONFIRMED)
activate OrderDB
OrderDB --> OrderService: Order Entity
deactivate OrderDB

OrderService --> Client: 201 Created\n(OrderResponse)
note right of OrderService
    성공 시나리오:
    - 주문 생성 완료
    - 결제 완료
    - 전체 트랜잭션 성공
end note
deactivate OrderService

@enduml

@startuml
!theme plain
allowmixing
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF

title Ch06.10: 통신 구조 - API 통신 시퀀스 (Circuit Breaker & Fallback)

participant "Client" as Client
participant "Order Service\n(Port 8080)" as OrderService
database "Order DB\n(orderdb)" as OrderDB
participant "PaymentClient\n(WebClient)" as PaymentClient
participant "Resilience4j\nCircuit Breaker" as CircuitBreaker
participant "Payment Service\n(Port 8081)" as PaymentService

Client -> OrderService: POST /api/orders\n(OrderCreateRequest)
activate OrderService

OrderService -> OrderDB: 주문 데이터 저장\n(PENDING 상태)
activate OrderDB
OrderDB --> OrderService: Order Entity
deactivate OrderDB

OrderService -> PaymentClient: processPayment(request)
activate PaymentClient

PaymentClient -> CircuitBreaker: Circuit Breaker 체크
activate CircuitBreaker

alt Circuit Breaker CLOSED
    CircuitBreaker -> PaymentService: API 호출 시도
    activate PaymentService
    
    alt Payment Service 정상
        PaymentService --> CircuitBreaker: PaymentResponse\n(성공)
        deactivate PaymentService
        CircuitBreaker --> PaymentClient: 성공 응답
    else Payment Service 장애
        PaymentService --> CircuitBreaker: 예외 발생
        deactivate PaymentService
        
        CircuitBreaker -> CircuitBreaker: 실패 카운트 증가
        note right of CircuitBreaker
            Circuit Breaker 상태:
            - 실패율 계산
            - 50% 이상이면 OPEN
        end note
        
        CircuitBreaker --> PaymentClient: 예외 전파
    end
else Circuit Breaker OPEN
    CircuitBreaker --> PaymentClient: 즉시 실패\n(Fallback 실행)
    note right of CircuitBreaker
        Circuit Breaker OPEN:
        - Payment Service 장애
        - 즉시 Fallback 실행
        - 추가 호출 차단
    end note
end

deactivate CircuitBreaker

alt Fallback 실행
    PaymentClient -> PaymentClient: processPaymentFallback()
    note right of PaymentClient
        Fallback 처리:
        - 보류 상태 응답 생성
        - PaymentStatus.PENDING
        - 주문은 유지
    end note
    PaymentClient --> OrderService: PaymentResponse\n(PENDING 상태)
else 정상 응답
    PaymentClient --> OrderService: PaymentResponse\n(COMPLETED 상태)
end

deactivate PaymentClient

alt 결제 성공
    OrderService -> OrderDB: 주문 상태 업데이트\n(CONFIRMED)
    activate OrderDB
    OrderDB --> OrderService: Order Entity
    deactivate OrderDB
else 결제 보류 (Fallback)
    note right of OrderService
        Fallback 처리:
        - 주문은 PENDING 상태 유지
        - 결제는 나중에 처리 가능
    end note
end

OrderService --> Client: 201 Created\n(OrderResponse)
deactivate OrderService

@enduml

@startuml
!theme plain
allowmixing
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF

title Ch06.10: 통신 구조 - Resilience4j 구성

package "Resilience4j 설정" {
    component "Circuit Breaker" as CB {
        note right
            설정:
            - slidingWindowSize: 10
            - failureRateThreshold: 50%
            - waitDurationInOpenState: 10s
            - minimumNumberOfCalls: 5
        end note
    }
    
    component "Retry" as Retry {
        note right
            설정:
            - maxAttempts: 3
            - waitDuration: 1s
            - exponentialBackoff: true
            - multiplier: 2
        end note
    }
    
    component "TimeLimiter" as Timeout {
        note right
            설정:
            - timeoutDuration: 5s
            - cancelRunningFuture: true
        end note
    }
}

component "PaymentClient\n(WebClient)" as PaymentClient

PaymentClient --> CB : @CircuitBreaker
PaymentClient --> Retry : @Retry
PaymentClient --> Timeout : @TimeLimiter

note bottom of PaymentClient
    적용 순서:
    1. Timeout (5초)
    2. Retry (최대 3회)
    3. Circuit Breaker (실패율 체크)
    4. Fallback (장애 시)
end note

@enduml

